  "display_title": "On a Restless Night",
  "description": "Born with the ability to see ghosts, Jong-Eun grew up inevitably dark and gloomy. One day, he discovers that Hye-Sung, a junior from another department he's paired with for a group project in a liberal arts class, is miraculously someone who can chase away ghosts.\n\n*I must bring him into my life by any means necessary.*\n\nOverwhelmed by the joy of a ghost-free daily life, Jong-Eun begins stalking Hye-Sung. But it doesn't take long before Hye-Sung catches him...\n\n *“Hey, why are you following me?”\n\n“......Because I like you too much.”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
